  "caption": "Same sea, same views, fewer people. That's shoulder season.\n\nOn the Mediterranean, May, June, September and early October often give you good weather, more choice of rooms and softer prices than July and August. Just check that the hotel and the ferries are running, and that no big local event lands on your dates.\n\nSave this for next year's trip.\n\n#shoulderseason #traveltips #travelhacks",
